  "note": "The one published PrismaBuild runtime generation the write-only produced-output tests run against (PQ #1084): write-only produced-output templates and origin batches (PB #912), their lifetime and retirement (PB #914) and the local spool's origin commit. The Stage B preparation's write-only publication (PQ #1070), the Stage A retirement against it (PQ #1073) and the band-serial handoff (PQ #1075) all read this file, so bumping it once moves every one of them; tests/test_pb_generation_pin_1084.py refuses a second pin file naming the same generation. The files are the union the suites need. The local-spool suite (tests/test_produced_output_spool_real_pb.py) moved onto this pin with PQ #1545: its old bundle predates prismabuild.client, which PQ now binds, and every file it pinned is in this union. The Stage A produced-output pin (stagea_produced_pb_pin.json) keeps its own candidate bundle. The bundle is read-only under runtime-generations; the digests below are what the tests check, and the tests skip loudly when nothing resolves against them."
